            <ArticleTitle>Facile synthesis of indolo[3,2-a]carbazoles via Pd-catalyzed twofold oxidative cyclization.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2490-2494</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3762/bjoc.12.243</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A rapid and efficient route has been developed for the synthesis of 9-methoxycarbonylindolo[3,2-a]carbazole derivatives. The key steps in this approach involved an aromatic amination and an oxidative biaryl coupling. Via the present route, indolo[3,2-a]carbazole derivatives are available in 3-4 steps based on commercially available starting materials.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
